@startuml project-status
' Supplementary to Level 4: the project status flow that PROJECT_MOVES in
' apps/api/src/lib/project.ts allows (ADR 0015). moveProjectStatus refuses any
' other move with 409. Each arrow names the endpoint that makes the move and
' who may call it; the role check lives in that endpoint, not in project.ts.

hide empty description
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #555555
skinparam StateBorderColor #3C7FC0
skinparam StateBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam StateBackgroundColor<<final>> #EAEAEA

title Project status — moveProjectStatus (lib/project.ts)

state AWAITING_QUOTATION
state AWAITING_DEPOSIT : Receiver may report the deposit\n(sets depositReportedAt, status stays)
state IN_PROGRESS : Provider may add progress notes
state AWAITING_ACCEPTANCE
state COMPLETED <<final>> : Receiver may write one review
state CANCELLED <<final>>

[*] --> AWAITING_QUOTATION : Listing owner accepts a proposal\n(acceptProposal → createProjectFromProposal)
AWAITING_QUOTATION --> AWAITING_DEPOSIT : Receiver accepts a quotation\n(acceptQuotation)
AWAITING_DEPOSIT --> IN_PROGRESS : Provider confirms the deposit\n(confirmDeposit)
IN_PROGRESS --> AWAITING_ACCEPTANCE : Provider submits the work\n(submitWork)
AWAITING_ACCEPTANCE --> IN_PROGRESS : Receiver rejects the work, with a reason\n(rejectWork)
AWAITING_ACCEPTANCE --> COMPLETED : Receiver accepts the work\n(acceptWork)
AWAITING_QUOTATION --> CANCELLED : Either party cancels\n(cancelProject)
AWAITING_DEPOSIT --> CANCELLED : Either party cancels\n(cancelProject)
COMPLETED --> [*]
CANCELLED --> [*]

note "Every move also saves one ProjectUpdate event\nin the same transaction, so a refused move saves none." as N1

@enduml
